        <p class="article-footnote">† See companion essay: <a href="https://www.wordsofplainness.org/studies/merognosticism/" class="article-companion-link"><em>Merognosticism — A Plain Confession of Partial Knowing</em></a>.</p>
        <p class="article-footnote">Something to share: if you know someone who approaches faith through evidence and argument, <a href="https://www.wordsofplainness.org/studies/approaches-to-belief/" class="article-companion-link"><em>Approaches to Belief</em></a> lays out theism, atheism, and agnosticism by their own best reasons — an interactive exercise you can hand to a skeptical friend and then talk through together.</p>
